        openings: ("A toddler was brought to an emergency room with burns on both legs and buttocks. The caregiver, {D}, says the child climbed into a hot bath, but a burn specialist found a pattern of immersion.", "The defense will point you to a water heater set far too high and a caregiver who ran to help. A dangerous setting is not the same as abuse."),
